WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.739 --> 00:00:07.288
This page turns each assessment into a concrete starting path so the blank page never wins.

2
00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:14.834
Pick the assessment you are starting. Each one shows what it asks, when it is due, and which weeks feed it.

3
00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:24.789
Follow the start path step by step. The path breaks the assessment into first moves you can do today, with the course material each move draws on.

4
00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:35.793
Open the Assignment Start Lab when you want a working session. The lab walks you through building a personal plan you can print or save. It is private and never submitted.

5
00:00:35.793 --> 00:00:45.189
Submit on Blackboard, always. This site helps you start and plan. The official assignment, rubric, and submission all live on Blackboard.

6
00:00:45.189 --> 00:00:50.990
Nothing here is submitted or graded. Blackboard is the only submission channel.

7
00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:55.865
Where next: Block one hour, open the lab, and leave with a plan.
